  {
   "id": "faye-falling-189136@1.3",
   "gameId": "faye-falling-189136",
   "displayName": "Update 1.3",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-05-12T02:56:53.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Version 1.3 of Faye Falling will be released next week on the 22nd of May! You can try the beta version early by selecting the beta branch from the build options.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update is the largest so far; it adds new equipment, a tea shop that grants temporary stat buffs, the ability to equip two rings, an expanded challenge mode, and lots more. You can see the draft of the patch notes here.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It also makes some significant changes under the hood, fixing memory leaks and making many optimisations. I am pretty confident the update is already bug-free...but naturally, fixing what already works can always be a little risky. So if you do try the beta, make sure to let me know in the comments or on the community forums if you run into any issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I also have two new games I'll be announcing soon. \"Spin Spirits\" is my big project I've been working on for a while. The other - \"Her Crown of Blood\" - is another little dark game like Faye that I just started recently. I'm really excited about both!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you next week,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jack",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
